OL,3,GNEWSACartoons to knitting: Half a
OL,4,Acentury of gentle protest goes on show
OL,5,
OL,6,FEqual rights have been fought for in
OL,7,Fmany different ways across the world,
OL,8,Fand sometimes those battles against
OL,9,Fdiscrimination have taken a quiet,
OL,10,Fsubtle form.
OL,12,FAn exhibition about how cartoons and
OL,13,Ftextiles have been used for gentle
OL,14,Fprotest has opened at Norwich Castle
OL,15,FMuseum.
OL,17,FCartoonist David Shenton has been
OL,18,Fdrawing since the 1970s and his work is
OL,19,Ffeatured in exhibition Kindly Ease The
OL,20,FTension, which focuses mainly on LGBTQ+
OL,21,Fissues, looking at events that have
OL,22,Fshaped his life.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
