OL,3,GNEWSACartoons to knitting: Half a
OL,4,Acentury of gentle protest goes on show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 77-year-old said he had been called
OL,7,Fa 'craftivist', which is a mix of
OL,8,Factivism and crafts, but insisted he
OL,9,F"didn't set out to be that".
